WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Place your key light at an angle.

00:00:02.055 --> 00:00:04.320
Turn off the overhead lamp. Keep the

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.380
light two feet away. Do not point

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.360
it into your eyes. Add a white

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.000
reflector beside you. Check the shadows on

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.800
your face. Lock the exposure before recording.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.600
Save Save this lighting setup.